          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "After a BSc, public sector jobs in railways, power companies, oil and gas firms and development banks come mainly through exams and recruitment notices, and the sensible approach is to read each official notice, prepare in stages and keep a private or skill-based fallback."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Check which posts accept BSc graduates, prepare for the written test pattern and keep documents and eligibility in order."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Use official recruitment pages and ignore anyone who offers a seat for money."
          }
        ]
      },
